caption: Demonstrated Eldritch Manifestations
domain-rule: demonstrated-eldritch-manifestations

A successful consequential Power Stunt may be recorded as a Demonstrated Eldritch Manifestation. Record the Latent or Realized Revelation being expressed, the Latent Gift used as the virtual source, the exact temporary build, its final point value, and the circumstances of the successful manifestation. A Demonstrated Eldritch Manifestation grants no free trait and no automatic permission to buy the ability.

Eldritch Gifts Traditions determine how Demonstrated Eldritch Manifestations may be stabilized, retained, transformed, or purchased permanently. The character must spend earned character points normally. If that permanent purchase is sufficient to represent the source Latent Gift under the granting rule, the Gift becomes Realized. If fewer than ten Gifts have been revealed, the character then reveals the next Latent Gift under the bounded Core procedure; once all ten Gifts have been revealed, no replacement is created.
